# es-f4-boxer-unequal-header: 3 s holds at throttle 0.5, with 0.5 s sweeps between them.
hold 770 0.5 3
sweep 770 2000 0.5 0.5
hold 2000 0.5 3
sweep 2000 3000 0.5 0.5
hold 3000 0.5 3
sweep 3000 4000 0.5 0.5
hold 4000 0.5 3
sweep 4000 5000 0.5 0.5
hold 5000 0.5 3
sweep 5000 6000 0.5 0.5
hold 6000 0.5 3
sweep 6000 6500 0.5 0.5
hold 6500 0.5 3
